{"suttaId":"vv43","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Vv","vriCode":"s0506m.mul","paras":[1619,1646],"vripara":"719"},"segments":{"vv43:0.4":"Kañjikadāyikāvimānavatthu","vv43:1.1":"“Abhikkantena vaṇṇena … pe … osadhī viya tārakā.","vv43:2.1":"“Kena tetādiso vaṇṇo … pe … vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatī”ti.","vv43:3.1":"Sā devatā attamanā … pe … yassa kammassidaṃ phalaṃ.","vv43:4.1":"“Ahaṃ andhakavindamhi, buddhassādiccabandhuno;","vv43:4.3":"Adāsiṃ kolasampākaṃ, kañjikaṃ teladhūpitaṃ.","vv43:5.1":"“Pipphalyā lasuṇena ca, missaṃ lāmañjakena ca;","vv43:5.3":"Adāsiṃ ujubhūtasmiṃ [ujubhūtesu (ka.)], vippasannena cetasā.","vv43:6.1":"“Yā mahesittaṃ kāreyya, cakkavattissa rājino;","vv43:6.3":"Nārī sabbaṅgakalyāṇī, bhattu cānomadassikā;","vv43:6.5":"Ekassa kañjikadānassa, kalaṃ nāgghati soḷasiṃ.","vv43:7.1":"“Sataṃ nikkhā sataṃ assā, sataṃ assatarīrathā;","vv43:7.3":"Sataṃ kaññāsahassāni, āmuttamaṇikuṇḍalā;","vv43:7.5":"Ekassa kañjikadānassa, kalaṃ nāgghanti soḷasiṃ.","vv43:8.1":"“Sataṃ hemavatā nāgā, īsādantā urūḷhavā;","vv43:8.3":"Suvaṇṇakacchā mātaṅgā, hemakappanavāsasā;","vv43:8.5":"Ekassa kañjikadānassa, kalaṃ nāgghanti soḷasiṃ.","vv43:9.1":"“Catunnamapi dīpānaṃ, issaraṃ yodha kāraye;","vv43:9.3":"Ekassa kañjikadānassa, kalaṃ nāgghati soḷasin”ti.","vv43:10.1":"Kañjikadāyikāvimānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
